# Raw evidence is bytes, not prose. Marking these binary stops git rendering
# megabyte diffs of them in PRs, reviews and `git log -p`, and stops a textual
# merge ever being attempted on an evidence file.
#
# It changes how git DISPLAYS and merges these paths. It does not change their
# content, their blob hashes, or any hash a disposition cites.

*.pcm            binary
*.wav            binary
observation.json binary

